 Brands\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://time.com/7177358/worlds-best-brands-united-states-2024/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1325/202506031933183670015.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"PC Guia Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Guia Online\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>PC Guia Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Strix SCAR 16 is a good gaming machine, but given its weight and dimensions, in my opinion, it's not a true laptop. It's more of a desktop PC that you can take on vacation. Despite having excellent graphics and a top-notch processor, it's a machine that costs too much, especially if you're going to use it exclusively for gaming.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>PORTUGAL</span> <span>05/20/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix SCAR 16 (2025) G635 Media review Award of PC Guia Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcguia.pt/2025/05/rog-strix-scar-16-2025-g635/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1285/202308102113440150898.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Great Design\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.pcreview.kz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Great Design</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Если вы готовы инвестировать в мощь и надёжность, SCAR 16 даст всё необходимое для уверенной победы в любой виртуальной битве и при этом обеспечит комфорт и долговечность на долгие годы.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>KAZAKHSTAN</span> <span>06/10/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix SCAR 16 (2025) G635 Media review Award of Great Design\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pcreview.kz/rog-strix-scar%e2%80%af16-g635-2025-obzor-igrovogo-noutbuka/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper